  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Enabling and Delivery Services - Mekong Australia Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Investment is for a Support Services Contractor for the delivery and implementation of the Mekong-Australia Partnership (MAP) in the Mekong Sub-Region.  The contractor delivers MAP Leadership and Skills program, enables MAP Trans-National Crime program and establishes a Support Unit for the Mekong Hub.</narrative>
  </description>
